Use Case Narrative: 
Use Case Name: Book Support Appointment 
Main actor: Student 
Other Actors: Support Staff

A student chooses a service from the system and views available timeslot (24 hours in advance), they explain why they want the appointment and book a timeslot with their selected staff member.

To make the appointment: The student must be enrolled at the college and authenticated and have shown to their most recent scheduled appointment.

What happens after making the appointment: The confirmed appointment is only visible to the support staff and student. The timeslot of the appointment is made unavailable for all other students to prevent double-booking. Appointment confirmation is sent to the student and support staff.

